  "notes": [
    "Diagram contains both a Connection Diagram and a Schematic (ladder) form; the netlist consolidates the visible conductors from both.",
    "*CH, *CHS, *SR, *SC, *ST, *HPS, *LPS are marked 'may be factory or field installed' — traced as shown.",
    "Start relay (*SR) internal pin numbering (1,2,5) and its exact tie into the start winding are partly overlapped/illegible in the photo; start-circuit nets n9-n13 are best-effort and should be field-verified.",
    "Board VS, VR and ODF terminals and the LLSR / K4 / ODFR logic outputs are shown on the schematic but their field wiring destinations were not clearly traceable in this image — omitted rather than guessed.",
    "PL2/PL3/PL4/PL5 plug connectors and internal board conductor routing (CC, HP, C, RVS, DEFROST TIME, QUIET SHIFT, UTIL headers) are internal to the board and not traced as discrete field nets.",
    "Optional non-communicating control block (R,C,Y,LS,W2,O per Note 13) and communicating DX+/DX- connections were not fully legible — not traced.",
    "Exact contactor auxiliary/coil terminal designations (C, 11, 21, 23) read from the drawing; coil supply path through the board (5-minute short-cycle protector) assumed per NOTE text."
  ]
}